ng:border-box\">    # Detection probability model</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    log(p[g]) &lt;- -(1/(2*sigma*sigma))*dist[g]*dist[g]</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><br><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    # Observation model</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    for(k in 1:2){</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">      y[g,k] ~ dbinom(p[g], N[g])</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    }</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><br><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    # Abundance model including GAM</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    N[g] ~ dpois(lam[g])</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    lam[g] &lt;- exp(beta0 + smooth[g] )</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">    smooth[g] &lt;- inprod(Z.mat[g,], b[])</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;display:table-cell;overflow:visible;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">  }</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 10px;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,&quot;SF Mono&quot;,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"><br></span></span></span></span><br>"
